Object.assign(window.__CMPDATA__=window.__CMPDATA__||{},{"dynamodb__17": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（Streams 做 CDC；备份按需/PITR）。 备份：按需备份+PITR（35 天）官方文档。 CDC：DynamoDB Streams（+Lambda 触发器）官方文档。 迁移：AWS DMS；导出到 S3（Parquet）做分析 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（Streams 做 CDC；备份按需/PITR）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>备份：按需备份+PITR（35 天）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>CDC：DynamoDB Streams（+Lambda 触发器）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>迁移：AWS DMS；导出到 S3（Parquet）做分析 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Streams for CDC; on-demand/PITR backup). Backup: on-demand + PITR (35 days) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. CDC: DynamoDB Streams (+ Lambda triggers) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Migrati…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Streams for CDC; on-demand/PITR backup).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Backup: on-demand + PITR (35 days) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>CDC: DynamoDB Streams (+ Lambda triggers) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Migration: AWS DMS; export to S3 (Parquet) for analytics <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__18": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（纯 Serverless，无自建版）。 DynamoDB 本身就是 Serverless：无服务器概念，按需/预置 官方文档。 无自建版；本地开发用 DynamoDB Local（功能子集）官方文档。 AWS 绑定 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（纯 Serverless，无自建版）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DynamoDB 本身就是 Serverless：无服务器概念，按需/预置 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无自建版；本地开发用 DynamoDB Local（功能子集）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>AWS 绑定 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (pure serverless; no self-hosted edition). DynamoDB is itself serverless: no servers, on-demand/provisioned <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No self-hosted edition; DynamoDB Lo…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (pure serverless; no self-hosted edition).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DynamoDB is itself serverless: no servers, on-demand/provisioned <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No self-hosted edition; DynamoDB Local (feature subset) for development <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>AWS-bound <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__19": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（S3 导入、BatchWriteItem、zero-ETL）。 Import from S3（CSV/DynamoDB JSON/ION）是官方批量导入通道 官方文档。 BatchWriteItem + 并行是 SDK 侧常规做法，注意 WCU 与限流 社区共识。 DynamoDB zero-ETL 集成到 Redshift 是新通道…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（S3 导入、BatchWriteItem、zero-ETL）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Import from S3（CSV/DynamoDB JSON/ION）是官方批量导入通道 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>BatchWriteItem + 并行是 SDK 侧常规做法，注意 WCU 与限流 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>DynamoDB zero-ETL 集成到 Redshift 是新通道 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (S3 import, BatchWriteItem, zero-ETL). Import from S3 (CSV/DynamoDB JSON/ION) is the official bulk channel <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. BatchWriteItem with parallelism is t…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (S3 import, BatchWriteItem, zero-ETL).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Import from S3 (CSV/DynamoDB JSON/ION) is the official bulk channel <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>BatchWriteItem with parallelism is the standard SDK approach; watch WCU and throttling <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>DynamoDB zero-ETL integration to Redshift is a newer channel <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__2": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。CloudTrail 记录管理面 API（建表、改容量、改策略）；数据面（GetItem/PutItem/Query）默认无审计，靠 CloudTrail data events（需单独启用、按量收费）或应用层日志。没有 SQL 审计日志式的&quot;谁查了哪行&quot;开箱能力。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。CloudTrail 记录<strong>管理面</strong> API（建表、改容量、改策略）；<strong>数据面</strong>（GetItem/PutItem/Query）默认无审计，靠 CloudTrail data events（需单独启用、按量收费）或应用层日志。没有 SQL 审计日志式的&quot;谁查了哪行&quot;开箱能力。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. CloudTrail records management-plane API calls (table creation, capacity changes, policy changes); the data plane (GetItem/PutItem/Que…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. CloudTrail records <strong>management-plane</strong> API calls (table creation, capacity changes, policy changes); the <strong>data plane</strong> (GetItem/PutItem/Query) has no auditing by default — rely on CloudTrail data events (must be enabled separately, metered billing) or application-layer logging. There is no out-of-the-box &quot;who read which row&quot; SQL-audit-log-style capability.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__20": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（自身无外部表；Athena 可联邦查 DynamoDB）。 DynamoDB 无外部表语义 官方文档。 Athena DynamoDB 连接器可做联邦查询 官方文档。 PartiQL 只能查本表，跨源要在上层做 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（自身无外部表；Athena 可联邦查 DynamoDB）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DynamoDB 无外部表语义 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Athena DynamoDB 连接器可做联邦查询 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>PartiQL 只能查本表，跨源要在上层做 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (No external tables natively; Athena can federate into DynamoDB). DynamoDB has no external-table semantics <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. The Athena DynamoDB connec…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (No external tables natively; Athena can federate into DynamoDB).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DynamoDB has no external-table semantics <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>The Athena DynamoDB connector enables federated queries <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>PartiQL only queries local tables; cross-source joins happen upstream <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__21": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（DynamoDB Streams：Lambda/Kinesis）。 DynamoDB Streams 提供 24 小时变更日志，可接 Lambda/Kinesis Data Streams 官方文档。 Kinesis Data Streams for DynamoDB 支持更长保留与多消费者 官方文档。 大写入量下 Stream 分片…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（DynamoDB Streams：Lambda/Kinesis）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DynamoDB Streams 提供 24 小时变更日志，可接 Lambda/Kinesis Data Streams <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Kinesis Data Streams for DynamoDB 支持更长保留与多消费者 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>大写入量下 Stream 分片热点与 Lambda 并发是调优点 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (DynamoDB Streams: Lambda/Kinesis). DynamoDB Streams provide a 24-hour change log feeding Lambda/Kinesis Data Streams <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Kinesis Data Streams for …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (DynamoDB Streams: Lambda/Kinesis).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DynamoDB Streams provide a 24-hour change log feeding Lambda/Kinesis Data Streams <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Kinesis Data Streams for DynamoDB adds longer retention and multiple consumers <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Stream shard hotspots and Lambda concurrency matter at high write rates <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__22": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（表级 TTL 属性，后台自动删不耗 WCU）。 表上指定 TTL 属性（epoch 秒），过期项后台自动删，不消耗写容量 官方文档。 删除延迟通常几小时内，不保证精确时刻 官方文档。 TTL 删除会产生 DynamoDB Streams 记录，可触发下游清理 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（表级 TTL 属性，后台自动删不耗 WCU）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>表上指定 TTL 属性（epoch 秒），过期项后台自动删，不消耗写容量 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>删除延迟通常几小时内，不保证精确时刻 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>TTL 删除会产生 DynamoDB Streams 记录，可触发下游清理 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Table-level TTL attribute; background deletes free of WCU). Designate a TTL attribute (epoch seconds); expired items are deleted in the background with no writ…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Table-level TTL attribute; background deletes free of WCU).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Designate a TTL attribute (epoch seconds); expired items are deleted in the background with no write-capacity cost <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Deletion lags by hours typically; not exact <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>TTL deletions emit DynamoDB Streams records, useful for downstream cleanup <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__23": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">不适用（schemaless，无 DDL 概念）。 无 schema，属性随时增减，无 DDL 痛点 官方文档。 加 GSI 是在线后台构建，大表回填耗时但不阻塞 官方文档。 GSI 回填期间写放大，WCU 规划要留余量 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>不适用</strong>（schemaless，无 DDL 概念）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无 schema，属性随时增减，无 DDL 痛点 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>加 GSI 是在线后台构建，大表回填耗时但不阻塞 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>GSI 回填期间写放大，WCU 规划要留余量 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">N/A (Schemaless; no DDL concept). No schema; attributes come and go with no DDL pain <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Adding a GSI builds online in the background; backfills take time on…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>N/A</strong> (Schemaless; no DDL concept).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No schema; attributes come and go with no DDL pain <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Adding a GSI builds online in the background; backfills take time on huge tables but don&#x27;t block <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>GSI backfill amplifies writes — leave WCU headroom <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__24": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（表级吞吐隔离；无集群内多租户）。 租户隔离靠多表/多账号，表级 WCU/按需计费天然隔离 官方文档。 单表内多租户无资源限流，需应用层分区键设计 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（表级吞吐隔离；无集群内多租户）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>租户隔离靠多表/多账号，表级 WCU/按需计费天然隔离 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>单表内多租户无资源限流，需应用层分区键设计 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Table-level throughput isolation; no in-cluster tenancy). Tenant isolation via multiple tables/accounts; per-table WCU/on-demand billing isolates naturally (offi…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Table-level throughput isolation; no in-cluster tenancy).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tenant isolation via multiple tables/accounts; per-table WCU/on-demand billing isolates naturally <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No resource throttling for multi-tenant single tables; design partition keys in the app <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__25": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（Global Tables 多活写）。 Global Tables 多区多活写，最终一致，冲突 last-writer-wins 官方文档。 冲突解决粗糙，不适合强一致多写场景 社区共识。 跨区复制延迟通常 1 秒内 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（Global Tables 多活写）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Global Tables 多区多活写，最终一致，冲突 last-writer-wins <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>冲突解决粗糙，不适合强一致多写场景 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>跨区复制延迟通常 1 秒内 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Global Tables active-active writes). Global Tables: multi-region active writes, eventually consistent, last-writer-wins conflicts <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Crude confli…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Global Tables active-active writes).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Global Tables: multi-region active writes, eventually consistent, last-writer-wins conflicts <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Crude conflict resolution; unfit for strong-consistency multi-write needs <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Cross-region replication lag typically under a second <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__26": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（托管多 AZ，SLA 99.99%）。 数据多 AZ 同步复制，AZ 故障自动容错 官方文档。 Global Tables 另有 99.999% SLA 档 官方文档。 RTO/RPO 由平台兜底，用户无感知 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（托管多 AZ，SLA 99.99%）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>数据多 AZ 同步复制，AZ 故障自动容错 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Global Tables 另有 99.999% SLA 档 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>RTO/RPO 由平台兜底，用户无感知 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Managed multi-AZ; 99.99% SLA). Data replicates synchronously across AZs with automatic AZ-failure tolerance <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Global Tables offer a 99.999% SLA …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Managed multi-AZ; 99.99% SLA).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Data replicates synchronously across AZs with automatic AZ-failure tolerance <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Global Tables offer a 99.999% SLA tier <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>RTO/RPO are the platform&#x27;s problem; users notice nothing <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__27": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（IAM条件键做细粒度行级控制）。 DynamoDB 无引擎内 RLS，官方推荐用 IAM policy 的 condition keys（如 dynamodb:LeadingKeys）实现按分区键的行级隔离 官方文档 列级控制靠 IAM 属性级权限（特定属性允许 / 拒绝） 官方文档 脱敏无内置能力，靠应用层 社区共识 IAM …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（IAM条件键做细粒度行级控制）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DynamoDB 无引擎内 RLS，官方推荐用 IAM policy 的 condition keys（如 dynamodb:LeadingKeys）实现按分区键的行级隔离 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>列级控制靠 IAM 属性级权限（特定属性允许 / 拒绝） <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>脱敏无内置能力，靠应用层 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>IAM 策略复杂度随租户数膨胀，是主要运维成本 <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Fine-grained row control via IAM condition keys). DynamoDB has no in-engine RLS; AWS recommends IAM policy condition keys (e.g. dynamodb:LeadingKeys) for partiti…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Fine-grained row control via IAM condition keys).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DynamoDB has no in-engine RLS; AWS recommends IAM policy condition keys (e.g. dynamodb:LeadingKeys) for partition-key row isolation <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Column control via IAM attribute-level permissions (allow / deny specific attributes) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>No built-in masking; the app layer handles it <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>IAM policy complexity balloons with tenant count, a major operational cost <code>(community tested)</code></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__28": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（文档模型原生，Map/List 嵌套）。 Map/List 嵌套文档原生，DynamoDB JSON 与 SDK 互转 官方文档。 单 item 400KB 上限，深嵌套文档注意条目大小 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（文档模型原生，Map/List 嵌套）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Map/List 嵌套文档原生，DynamoDB JSON 与 SDK 互转 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>单 item 400KB 上限，深嵌套文档注意条目大小 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Native nested Map/List documents). Native nested Map/List documents; DynamoDB JSON interop with SDKs <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. 400KB per-item cap; watch size on deeply …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Native nested Map/List documents).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Native nested Map/List documents; DynamoDB JSON interop with SDKs <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>400KB per-item cap; watch size on deeply nested docs <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__29": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（查证为无；外挂 OpenSearch）。 无全文检索（查证为无）官方文档。 标准方案 DynamoDB Streams + OpenSearch，延迟与成本自负 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（查证为无；外挂 OpenSearch）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无全文检索（查证为无）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>标准方案 DynamoDB Streams + OpenSearch，延迟与成本自负 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (Verified absent; use OpenSearch). No full-text search (verified absent) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Standard: DynamoDB Streams + OpenSearch; latency and cost on you (…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (Verified absent; use OpenSearch).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No full-text search (verified absent) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Standard: DynamoDB Streams + OpenSearch; latency and cost on you <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__3": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。无用户名密码，IAM SigV4 签名；细粒度访问控制（dynamodb:LeadingKeys 行级、dynamodb:Attributes 列级），多租户隔离的标准做法。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。无用户名密码，IAM SigV4 签名；细粒度访问控制（<code>dynamodb:LeadingKeys</code> 行级、<code>dynamodb:Attributes</code> 列级），多租户隔离的标准做法。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No username/password; IAM SigV4 signatures; fine-grained access control (row-level via dynamodb:LeadingKeys, column-level via dynamodb:Attribut…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No username/password; IAM SigV4 signatures; fine-grained access control (row-level via <code>dynamodb:LeadingKeys</code>, column-level via <code>dynamodb:Attributes</code>) — the standard practice for multi-tenant isolation.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__30": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（存储黑盒；按量计费无调优）。 存储层为 AWS 黑盒自动管理，用户按存储量与读写容量付费，无压缩调优参数。官方文档 官方未公开压缩算法与压缩比，存储效率不可观测、不可调。待验证 单表设计等建模技巧可减少冗余，属应用层优化而非引擎压缩能力。社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（存储黑盒；按量计费无调优）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>存储层为 AWS 黑盒自动管理，用户按存储量与读写容量付费，无压缩调优参数。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>官方未公开压缩算法与压缩比，存储效率不可观测、不可调。<span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span></li>\n<li>单表设计等建模技巧可减少冗余，属应用层优化而非引擎压缩能力。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Black-box storage; usage-based billing). The storage layer is AWS-managed black box; users pay for storage and read/write capacity with no compression tunables. …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Black-box storage; usage-based billing).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The storage layer is AWS-managed black box; users pay for storage and read/write capacity with no compression tunables. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Compression algorithms and ratios are undisclosed; storage efficiency is neither observable nor tunable. <code>(to be verified)</code></li>\n<li>Modeling techniques like single-table design reduce redundancy, but that is application-layer optimization, not engine compression. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__31": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（AWS 专属；API 绑定深）。 DynamoDB 是 AWS 专属托管 NoSQL 服务，无开源版本，完全绑定 AWS。官方文档 API 与数据建模（单表设计、GSI/LSI）深度绑定，迁出需重构访问模式。社区共识 存在开源兼容实现（如测试级 LocalStack），但生产级替代缺失。社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（AWS 专属；API 绑定深）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DynamoDB 是 AWS 专属托管 NoSQL 服务，无开源版本，完全绑定 AWS。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>API 与数据建模（单表设计、GSI/LSI）深度绑定，迁出需重构访问模式。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>存在开源兼容实现（如测试级 LocalStack），但生产级替代缺失。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (AWS-exclusive; deep API binding). DynamoDB is an AWS-exclusive managed NoSQL service with no open-source edition, fully bound to AWS. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> Its API a…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (AWS-exclusive; deep API binding).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DynamoDB is an AWS-exclusive managed NoSQL service with no open-source edition, fully bound to AWS. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Its API and data modeling (single-table design, GSI/LSI) bind deeply; migrating out requires reworking access patterns. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>Open-source-compatible implementations exist (e.g. test-grade LocalStack), but no production-grade alternative. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__32": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">不适用（无优化器：单表设计，查询固定）。 无 CBO/计划概念，性能由单表建模与 GSI 设计决定 官方文档。 查询模式固定，可预测性强，但复杂查询需应用层组装 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>不适用</strong>（无优化器：单表设计，查询固定）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无 CBO/计划概念，性能由单表建模与 GSI 设计决定 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>查询模式固定，可预测性强，但复杂查询需应用层组装 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">N/A (No optimizer: single-table design, fixed patterns). No CBO/plan concept; performance comes from single-table modeling and GSI design <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Fixed access pa…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>N/A</strong> (No optimizer: single-table design, fixed patterns).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No CBO/plan concept; performance comes from single-table modeling and GSI design <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Fixed access patterns are highly predictable, but complex queries need app-side assembly <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__33": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（Serverless 自治：零调参）。 按需/预置+自动扩缩容，几乎零参数 官方文档。 容量规划转为 WCU/RCU 成本规划 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（Serverless 自治：零调参）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>按需/预置+自动扩缩容，几乎零参数 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>容量规划转为 WCU/RCU 成本规划 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Serverless autonomy: zero knobs). On-demand/provisioned with auto scaling; near-zero parameters <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Capacity planning becomes WCU/RCU cost plannin…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Serverless autonomy: zero knobs).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>On-demand/provisioned with auto scaling; near-zero parameters <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Capacity planning becomes WCU/RCU cost planning <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__34": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（云厂商底层兜底，用户无可见校验开关）。 存储层多副本同步复制，底层校验与自愈由 AWS 内部完成。官方文档 用户侧无页校验开关、校验命令或损坏审计视图。社区共识 连续备份/PITR 防的是逻辑损坏，静默位损坏不在用户可观测范围。官方文档</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（云厂商底层兜底，用户无可见校验开关）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>存储层多副本同步复制，底层校验与自愈由 AWS 内部完成。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>用户侧无页校验开关、校验命令或损坏审计视图。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>连续备份/PITR 防的是逻辑损坏，静默位损坏不在用户可观测范围。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Cloud checks; no user controls). Multi-copy synchronous replication with low-level checks and self-healing handled internally by AWS. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> No user-fac…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Cloud checks; no user controls).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Multi-copy synchronous replication with low-level checks and self-healing handled internally by AWS. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>No user-facing checksum switch, verification command, or corruption audit view. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>Continuous backups/PITR guard against logical corruption; silent bit-rot is outside user observability. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__35": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">不适用（KV 无过程语言概念）。 无存储过程/触发器概念（不适用）官方文档。 流处理靠 Streams + Lambda 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>不适用</strong>（KV 无过程语言概念）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无存储过程/触发器概念（不适用）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>流处理靠 Streams + Lambda <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">N/A (No procedural concept in KV). No stored-procedure/trigger concept (N/A) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Stream processing via Streams + Lambda <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>N/A</strong> (No procedural concept in KV).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No stored-procedure/trigger concept (N/A) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Stream processing via Streams + Lambda <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__36": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（无外键/CHECK；条件写入）。 无外键、CHECK（查证为无），条件写入做乐观锁 官方文档。 完整性应用层保证 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（无外键/CHECK；条件写入）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无外键、CHECK（查证为无），条件写入做乐观锁 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>完整性应用层保证 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (No FK/CHECK; conditional writes). No FK or CHECK (verified absent); conditional writes for optimistic locking <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Integrity in app layer (comm…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (No FK/CHECK; conditional writes).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No FK or CHECK (verified absent); conditional writes for optimistic locking <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Integrity in app layer <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__37": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">不适用（PartiQL 有限；分析靠导出）。 PartiQL 查询能力有限，无窗口函数（不适用分析 SQL）官方文档。 分析靠导出 S3 + Athena/EMR 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>不适用</strong>（PartiQL 有限；分析靠导出）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PartiQL 查询能力有限，无窗口函数（不适用分析 SQL）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>分析靠导出 S3 + Athena/EMR <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">N/A (Limited PartiQL; export for analytics). Limited PartiQL, no window functions (N/A for analytical SQL) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Analytics via export to S3 + Athena/EMR (offic…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>N/A</strong> (Limited PartiQL; export for analytics).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Limited PartiQL, no window functions (N/A for analytical SQL) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Analytics via export to S3 + Athena/EMR <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__38": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（DeleteItem即删；备份/PITR残留）。 DeleteItem 即时删除，无原生擦除证明 官方文档 按需备份与 PITR（35 天）窗口内可恢复被删数据 官方文档 TTL 删除是异步的，删除时间不精确，合规场景不能依赖 TTL 做“准时擦除” 社区实测 全局表多区域复制放大残留面 社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（DeleteItem即删；备份/PITR残留）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DeleteItem 即时删除，无原生擦除证明 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>按需备份与 PITR（35 天）窗口内可恢复被删数据 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>TTL 删除是异步的，删除时间不精确，合规场景不能依赖 TTL 做“准时擦除” <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span></li>\n<li>全局表多区域复制放大残留面 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (DeleteItem is immediate; backup/PITR residue). DeleteItem deletes immediately; no native erasure attestation <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> On-demand backups and PITR (35 days)…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (DeleteItem is immediate; backup/PITR residue).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DeleteItem deletes immediately; no native erasure attestation <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>On-demand backups and PITR (35 days) can restore deleted data inside the window <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>TTL deletion is asynchronous with imprecise timing; compliance scenarios cannot rely on TTL for on-time erasure <code>(community tested)</code></li>\n<li>Global-table multi-region replication widens the residue surface <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__39": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（Glue Catalog 集成；无原生列级血缘）。 可导出/爬网至 Glue Data Catalog 官方文档。 无原生列级血缘 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（Glue Catalog 集成；无原生列级血缘）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>可导出/爬网至 Glue Data Catalog <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无原生列级血缘 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Glue Catalog integration; no native column lineage). Can export/crawl into Glue Data Catalog <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No native column-level lineage (community consensus…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Glue Catalog integration; no native column lineage).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Can export/crawl into Glue Data Catalog <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No native column-level lineage <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__4": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。PITR 连续备份（2025-01 起保留期 1–35 天可配）+ 秒级时间点恢复；on-demand 全量备份（可永久保留）；AWS Backup 集成。关键限制：恢复只能生成新表，不支持原地覆盖/回滚<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>，&quot;回滚到 10 分钟前&quot;意味着切流量到新表。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。PITR 连续备份（2025-01 起保留期 1–35 天可配）+ 秒级时间点恢复；on-demand 全量备份（可永久保留）；AWS Backup 集成。关键限制：<strong>恢复只能生成新表，不支持原地覆盖/回滚</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>，&quot;回滚到 10 分钟前&quot;意味着切流量到新表。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. PITR continuous backups (retention configurable 1–35 days since 2025-01) + second-level point-in-time restore; on-demand full backups (retained…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. PITR continuous backups (retention configurable 1–35 days since 2025-01) + second-level point-in-time restore; on-demand full backups (retained indefinitely); AWS Backup integration. Key limitation: <strong>recovery only creates a new table — no in-place overwrite/rollback</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. &quot;Roll back to 10 minutes ago&quot; means cutting traffic to a new table.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__40": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（全托管存算分离）。 全托管，存储自动分区扩缩，计算无感 官方文档。 用户不感知架构，弹性由服务保证 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（全托管存算分离）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>全托管，存储自动分区扩缩，计算无感 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>用户不感知架构，弹性由服务保证 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Fully managed disaggregation). Fully managed; storage auto-partitions and scales invisibly <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Architecture invisible to users; elasticity guarant…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Fully managed disaggregation).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fully managed; storage auto-partitions and scales invisibly <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Architecture invisible to users; elasticity guaranteed by the service <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__41": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（纯 KV/文档，无多模）。 仅 KV/文档模型，无向量/全文/图原生能力 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（纯 KV/文档，无多模）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>仅 KV/文档模型，无向量/全文/图原生能力 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (Pure KV/document; no multi-model). KV/document only; no native vector/full-text/graph <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (Pure KV/document; no multi-model).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>KV/document only; no native vector/full-text/graph <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__42": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（按请求/容量计费，标签归因完整）。 支持按请求与预置容量两种模式，账单细化到表级。官方文档 成本分配标签 + Cost Explorer + AWS Budgets，归因与告警链路完整。官方文档</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（按请求/容量计费，标签归因完整）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>支持按请求与预置容量两种模式，账单细化到表级。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>成本分配标签 + Cost Explorer + AWS Budgets，归因与告警链路完整。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (On-demand/provisioned; tag attribution). On-demand and provisioned capacity modes with billing broken down to table level. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> Cost allocation tags…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (On-demand/provisioned; tag attribution).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>On-demand and provisioned capacity modes with billing broken down to table level. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Cost allocation tags plus Cost Explorer plus AWS Budgets give a complete attribution and alerting chain. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__43": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（AWS SDK 各语言；JDBC 靠 Simba）。 AWS SDK（Java/Python/Node/Go）为一等接入 官方文档。 JDBC/ODBC 靠 Simba 第三方驱动 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（AWS SDK 各语言；JDBC 靠 Simba）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>AWS SDK（Java/Python/Node/Go）为一等接入 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>JDBC/ODBC 靠 Simba 第三方驱动 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (AWS SDKs for all languages; JDBC/ODBC via Simba). AWS SDKs (Java/Python/Node/Go) are first-class <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. JDBC/ODBC via third-party Simba drivers (comm…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (AWS SDKs for all languages; JDBC/ODBC via Simba).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>AWS SDKs (Java/Python/Node/Go) are first-class <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>JDBC/ODBC via third-party Simba drivers <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__44": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">不适用（KV 无物化视图概念）。 无物化视图概念（不适用）官方文档。 预聚合靠 Streams 物化到另一张表 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>不适用</strong>（KV 无物化视图概念）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无物化视图概念（不适用）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>预聚合靠 Streams 物化到另一张表 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">N/A (No MV concept in KV). No materialized-view concept (N/A) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Pre-aggregate via Streams into another table <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>N/A</strong> (No MV concept in KV).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No materialized-view concept (N/A) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Pre-aggregate via Streams into another table <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__45": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（AWS 绑定，无跨云）。 仅 AWS，无其他云版本 官方文档。 迁出靠导出到 S3 + 导入目标库，无跨云复制 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（AWS 绑定，无跨云）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>仅 AWS，无其他云版本 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>迁出靠导出到 S3 + 导入目标库，无跨云复制 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (AWS-bound; no cross-cloud). AWS-only; no other-cloud offering <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Moving out via S3 export + import; no cross-cloud replication (community con…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (AWS-bound; no cross-cloud).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>AWS-only; no other-cloud offering <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Moving out via S3 export + import; no cross-cloud replication <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__46": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（自适应容量自动吸热点，分区硬上限兜不住）。 并发控制原语是无锁单 item 原子写：同一 item 并发写后写覆盖（LWW），无锁等待、无写冲突 abort；条件写（ConditionExpression）失败返回 ConditionalCheckFailedException，由应用决定是否重试，内核不重试；事务写 Trans…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（自适应容量自动吸热点，分区硬上限兜不住）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>并发控制原语是无锁单 item 原子写：同一 item 并发写后写覆盖（LWW），无锁等待、无写冲突 abort；条件写（ConditionExpression）失败返回 ConditionalCheckFailedException，由应用决定是否重试，内核不重试；事务写 TransactWriteItems 遇冲突或条件失败整体取消，同样应用层重试。重试归属要分两层：节流抛出的 ProvisionedThroughputExceededException 由 AWS SDK 按指数退避自动重试（驱动层），业务语义冲突由应用层处理。衰减不来自锁，来自限流<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>衰减形态：流量按分区键哈希落分区，单分区硬上限 3000 RCU / 1000 WCU（物理节点能力），超限即节流——表总容量再富余也救不了单个热分区；热点 key 的延迟从个位数毫秒突变为节流重试风暴。单点瓶颈：单个分区键值 = 单个分区，有 LSI 的表还会限制分区拆分<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>内置缓解：自适应容量（adaptive capacity，2018 年引入）默认开启、免费——自动把冷分区的闲置吞吐调给热分区，并把持续高频访问的 item 隔离到独立分区（单 item 可吃满 3000 RCU / 1000 WCU）；突发容量（burst capacity，保留最多 300 秒未用容量）吸收短时峰值。边界：自适应不能突破单分区硬上限，也救不了单调递增排序键造成的不可拆分热点——这是物理上限，不是配额；自适应容量对持续热 item 的隔离重平衡生效有滞后（社区口径：约 5–30 分钟才逐步生效），突发热点在生效前仍先被节流，burst capacity 只能吸收 300 秒以内的短时峰值<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>应用层模式与代价：写分片——热逻辑 key 加随机后缀拆成 N 个物理分区键（如 <code>EVENT#123#00</code>…<code>#15</code>），读时聚合（代价：读放大、聚合逻辑进应用层）；读热点前置 DAX 或应用缓存（代价：DAX 另计费、限 VPC、写穿复杂度）；不可预测峰值用 on-demand 模式（代价：单价高于预置容量）。建模铁律：分区键选高基数、忌时间戳/状态等低基数键，这是官方分区键设计指南的首要规则——热点首先是建模问题<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (Adaptive capacity absorbs hot partitions, but a hard per-partition cap remains). The concurrency primitive is lock-free, per-item atomic writes: conc…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (Adaptive capacity absorbs hot partitions, but a hard per-partition cap remains).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The concurrency primitive is lock-free, per-item atomic writes: concurrent writes to one item resolve last-writer-wins, with no lock waiting and no write-conflict abort. A failed conditional write (ConditionExpression) returns ConditionalCheckFailedException for the application to decide on retry — the core does not retry. A TransactWriteItems call cancels entirely on conflict or condition failure, again retried application-side. Retry ownership splits two ways: throttling (ProvisionedThroughputExceededException) is retried automatically by the AWS SDK with exponential backoff (driver layer), while business-semantic conflicts are the application&#x27;s. Decay comes from throttling, not locks <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Decay shape: traffic lands on partitions by partition-key hash, and each partition has a hard ceiling of 3,000 RCU / 1,000 WCU (physical node capacity). Exceeding it throttles — no amount of spare table-level capacity rescues a single hot partition — and a hot key&#x27;s latency jumps from single-digit milliseconds to a throttling retry storm. Single-point bottleneck: one partition-key value equals one partition, and tables with an LSI further constrain partition splitting <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Built-in mitigation: adaptive capacity (introduced 2018) is on by default at no cost — it automatically lends idle throughput from cold partitions to hot ones and isolates persistently hot items onto dedicated partitions (a single item can consume the full 3,000 RCU / 1,000 WCU); burst capacity (up to 300 seconds of banked unused capacity) absorbs short spikes. Boundary: adaptive capacity cannot breach the per-partition hard ceiling, nor rescue unsplittable hotspots caused by monotonically increasing sort keys — this is a physical limit, not a quota; the isolation rebalance for persistently hot items lags (community account: roughly 5–30 minutes before fully taking effect), so bursty hotspots are throttled first in the meantime, and burst capacity only absorbs spikes under 300 seconds <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Application patterns and costs: write sharding — append a random suffix to split a hot logical key into N physical partition keys (e.g. <code>EVENT#123#00</code>…<code>#15</code>) and aggregate on read (cost: read amplification, aggregation logic moves into the application); DAX or an application cache in front of read hotspots (cost: DAX billed separately, VPC-bound, write-through complexity); on-demand mode for unpredictable spikes (cost: higher unit price than provisioned capacity). The modeling rule: choose high-cardinality partition keys and avoid low-cardinality ones like timestamps or statuses — the first rule of the official partition-key design guide. Hotspots are first a modeling problem <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__5": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。CloudWatch 指标（ConsumedRCU/WCU、ThrottledRequests、ReplicationLatency、SystemErrors 等）；Contributor Insights 定位热 key/热分区；CloudTrail；DAX 有独立指标。慢查询概念不存在——只有&quot;被节流的请求&quot;。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。CloudWatch 指标（ConsumedRCU/WCU、ThrottledRequests、ReplicationLatency、SystemErrors 等）；Contributor Insights 定位热 key/热分区；CloudTrail；DAX 有独立指标。慢查询概念不存在——只有&quot;被节流的请求&quot;。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. CloudWatch metrics (ConsumedRCU/WCU, ThrottledRequests, ReplicationLatency, SystemErrors, etc.); Contributor Insights to locate hot keys/hot pa…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. CloudWatch metrics (ConsumedRCU/WCU, ThrottledRequests, ReplicationLatency, SystemErrors, etc.); Contributor Insights to locate hot keys/hot partitions; CloudTrail; DAX has its own metrics. The concept of &quot;slow queries&quot; doesn&#x27;t exist — only &quot;throttled requests.&quot;</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__6": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。HTTPS API，无连接、无连接池——连接风暴问题天然不存在；但&quot;连接&quot;换成了&quot;吞吐配额&quot;，突发超 2 倍历史峰值 30 分钟内仍可能被节流（社区技能文档口径）。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。HTTPS API，无连接、无连接池——连接风暴问题天然不存在；但&quot;连接&quot;换成了&quot;吞吐配额&quot;，突发超 2 倍历史峰值 30 分钟内仍可能被节流（社区技能文档口径）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. HTTPS API, no connections, no connection pools — connection storms are a non-issue by construction. But &quot;connections&quot; are replaced by &quot;throughp…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. HTTPS API, no connections, no connection pools — connection storms are a non-issue by construction. But &quot;connections&quot; are replaced by &quot;throughput quotas&quot;: bursts exceeding 2x the historical peak can still be throttled within 30 minutes (community skill docs wording).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__7": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。TransactWriteItems（最多 100 项/4MB，2x WCU）、TransactGetItems（最多 100 项/4MB）；ClientRequestToken 幂等；单 Region 内 ACID。限制：事务仅单 Region（MRSC Global Tables 不支持事务）；默认读最终一致，Cons…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。<code>TransactWriteItems</code>（最多 100 项/4MB，<strong>2x WCU</strong>）、<code>TransactGetItems</code>（最多 100 项/4MB）；<code>ClientRequestToken</code> 幂等；单 Region 内 ACID。限制：事务仅单 Region（MRSC Global Tables 不支持事务）；默认读最终一致，<code>ConsistentRead=True</code> 得强一致（2x RCU）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. TransactWriteItems (max 100 items / 4MB, 2x WCU), TransactGetItems (max 100 items / 4MB); ClientRequestToken for idempotency; ACID within a sin…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. <code>TransactWriteItems</code> (max 100 items / 4MB, <strong>2x WCU</strong>), <code>TransactGetItems</code> (max 100 items / 4MB); <code>ClientRequestToken</code> for idempotency; ACID within a single region. Limitations: transactions are single-region only (MRSC Global Tables don&#x27;t support transactions); reads are eventually consistent by default — <code>ConsistentRead=True</code> gets strong consistency (2x RCU).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__8": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。表内 3 AZ 同步复制；读默认最终一致（通常 &lt;1 秒收敛，厂商口径）；跨 Region Global Tables：MREC（异步，last-writer-wins）或 MRSC（同步 quorum，需 3 Region 固定拓扑）。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。表内 3 AZ 同步复制；读默认最终一致（通常 &lt;1 秒收敛，厂商口径）；跨 Region Global Tables：MREC（异步，last-writer-wins）或 MRSC（同步 quorum，需 3 Region 固定拓扑）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. 3-AZ synchronous replication within a table; reads default to eventual consistency (usually converging in &lt;1 second — vendor claim); cross-regi…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. 3-AZ synchronous replication within a table; reads default to eventual consistency (usually converging in &lt;1 second — vendor claim); cross-region Global Tables: MREC (async, last-writer-wins) or MRSC (synchronous quorum, requires a fixed 3-region topology).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__9": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有，在线</span><p class=\"snippet\">有，在线<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。存储驱动自动分区（无感）；吞吐按 on-demand 自动或 provisioned/auto-scaling 调整；无纵向扩展概念。分区是&quot;只增&quot;逻辑，热 key 无法靠加分区解决（见深水区一）。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有，在线</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。存储驱动自动分区（无感）；吞吐按 on-demand 自动或 provisioned/auto-scaling 调整；无纵向扩展概念。分区是&quot;只增&quot;逻辑，热 key 无法靠加分区解决（见深水区一）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported, online <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Storage-driven automatic partitioning (invisible to you); throughput adjusts via on-demand auto or provisioned/auto-scaling; no vertica…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported, online</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Storage-driven automatic partitioning (invisible to you); throughput adjusts via on-demand auto or provisioned/auto-scaling; no vertical-scaling concept. Partitions only ever grow — hot keys can&#x27;t be solved by adding partitions (see Deep-dive 1).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "edb__0": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——EPAS/PGE 15+ 内核级 TDE（数据文件 + WAL + 查询临时文件，对应用透明；密钥可经 PGDATAKEYWRAPCMD/UNWRAPCMD 对接外部 KMS）；initdb 时决定，事后难改。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>（2026-09-28 查阅）。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>——EPAS/PGE 15+ 内核级 TDE（数据文件 + WAL + 查询临时文件，对应用透明；密钥可经 PGDATAKEYWRAPCMD/UNWRAPCMD 对接外部 KMS）；initdb 时决定，事后难改。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>（2026-09-28 查阅）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — EPAS/PGE 15+ kernel-level TDE (data files + WAL + query temp files, transparent to applications; keys can integrate with external KMS via PGDATAKEYWRAPCMD/UNW…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> — EPAS/PGE 15+ kernel-level TDE (data files + WAL + query temp files, transparent to applications; keys can integrate with external KMS via PGDATAKEYWRAPCMD/UNWRAPCMD); decided at initdb time, hard to change afterwards. Evidence: official docs (reviewed 2026-09-28).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "edb__1": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——TLS/SSL（继承 PG 机制，ssl=on + 证书配置）。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>（PG 机制沿用），官方文档待逐项复核。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>——TLS/SSL（继承 PG 机制，<code>ssl=on</code> + 证书配置）。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>（PG 机制沿用），官方文档待逐项复核。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — TLS/SSL (inherits the PG mechanism, ssl=on + certificate configuration). Evidence: community consensus (PG mechanism carried over), official docs pending item…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> — TLS/SSL (inherits the PG mechanism, <code>ssl=on</code> + certificate configuration). Evidence: community consensus (PG mechanism carried over), official docs pending item-by-item re-verification.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "edb__10": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——PostgreSQL 协议/生态兼容；EPAS 另有 Oracle 兼容模式（SPL、Oracle 数据类型/SQL/数据字典视图、MERGE、OCI/OCL 互操作），语义缺口见深水区一、二。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>——PostgreSQL 协议/生态兼容；EPAS 另有 Oracle 兼容模式（SPL、Oracle 数据类型/SQL/数据字典视图、MERGE、OCI/OCL 互操作），语义缺口见深水区一、二。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — PostgreSQL protocol/ecosystem compatible; EPAS additionally offers an Oracle compatibility mode (SPL, Oracle data types/SQL/data-dictionary views, MERGE, OCI/…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> — PostgreSQL protocol/ecosystem compatible; EPAS additionally offers an Oracle compatibility mode (SPL, Oracle data types/SQL/data-dictionary views, MERGE, OCI/OCL interop); semantic gaps: see Deep Dives 1–2. Evidence: official docs.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "edb__11": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（商业订阅）</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（商业订阅）——按 uniCore（物理核或分配给 VM 的 vCore/vCPU）或 Server 计量，以订单为准；非永久授权，订阅到期即失去商业软件使用权。当前公开材料未发现可靠统一标价，按惯例询价。证据：EDB 现行订阅协议（2026-09-28 查阅，官方口径）。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有（商业订阅）</strong>——按 <code>uniCore</code>（物理核或分配给 VM 的 vCore/vCPU）或 <code>Server</code> 计量，以订单为准；非永久授权，订阅到期即失去商业软件使用权。<strong>当前公开材料未发现可靠统一标价，按惯例询价。</strong>证据：EDB 现行订阅协议（2026-09-28 查阅，官方口径）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (commercial subscription) — metered in uniCore (physical cores or vCores/vCPUs allocated to VMs) or Server units, per the order form; not a perpetual license — …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported (commercial subscription)</strong> — metered in <code>uniCore</code> (physical cores or vCores/vCPUs allocated to VMs) or <code>Server</code> units, per the order form; not a perpetual license — commercial software rights lapse when the subscription expires. <strong>No reliable unified list price found in current public materials; expect quote-based pricing.</strong> Evidence: EDB&#x27;s current subscription agreement (reviewed 2026-09-28, vendor claim).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "edb__12": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持——官方文档以英文为主；国内社区实践内容明显少于 MySQL / OceanBase。证据：编辑判断（待规模化采集验证）。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>——官方文档以英文为主；国内社区实践内容明显少于 MySQL / OceanBase。证据：编辑判断（待规模化采集验证）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported — official docs are primarily in English; domestic community practice content is clearly sparser than for MySQL / OceanBase. Evidence: editorial judgm…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> — official docs are primarily in English; domestic community practice content is clearly sparser than for MySQL / OceanBase. Evidence: editorial judgment (pending scaled collection verification).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "edb__13": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（基线即 PG；Oracle 兼容模式有转义开销）。 EPAS 性能基线与社区 PG 一致：并行查询、分区表、分片扩展能力相同 社区共识。 Oracle 兼容模式（存储过程/包/语法转义）有额外开销，性能关键路径建议实测 社区共识。 大对象/分区等企业特性不改变单机性能上限 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（基线即 PG；Oracle 兼容模式有转义开销）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>EPAS 性能基线与社区 PG 一致：并行查询、分区表、分片扩展能力相同 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>Oracle 兼容模式（存储过程/包/语法转义）有额外开销，性能关键路径建议实测 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>大对象/分区等企业特性不改变单机性能上限 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (baseline is PostgreSQL; Oracle-compat mode adds translation overhead). EPAS performance baseline matches community PostgreSQL: parallel queries, partitioning, …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (baseline is PostgreSQL; Oracle-compat mode adds translation overhead).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>EPAS performance baseline matches community PostgreSQL: parallel queries, partitioning, sharding behave the same <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Oracle compatibility mode (procedures/packages/syntax translation) adds overhead — benchmark performance-critical paths <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Enterprise features (large objects, partitioning) don&#x27;t raise the single-node ceiling <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "edb__14": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（国际认证走 EDB 厂商体系；国内靠项目测评）。 EDB 公开 SOC2 等企业合规信息（厂商口径，以官方合规页为准）厂商口径。 中国区：无信创名录公开信息；政企项目合规以上云/本地部署测评为准 待验证。 开源 PG 部分无官方认证，见 postgresql 条目 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（国际认证走 EDB 厂商体系；国内靠项目测评）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>EDB 公开 SOC2 等企业合规信息（厂商口径，以官方合规页为准）<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>中国区：无信创名录公开信息；政企项目合规以上云/本地部署测评为准 <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>。</li>\n<li>开源 PG 部分无官方认证，见 postgresql 条目 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (international certs via EDB; China via project assessment). EDB publishes SOC2 and other enterprise compliance (vendor claim, per its compliance page…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (international certs via EDB; China via project assessment).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>EDB publishes SOC2 and other enterprise compliance (vendor claim, per its compliance page) <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>China: no public trusted-innovation catalog information; government/enterprise compliance via cloud or on-premises assessment <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>.</li>\n<li>Open-source PostgreSQL parts carry no official certs — see the PostgreSQL entry <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>"});